
>> countries := ລິສ ໃໝ່
	~ ['Switzerland']
	~ ['Italy']
	~ ['Germany'].

>> foods := ລິສ ໃໝ່
	~ ['Rösti']
	~ ['Spaghetti']
	~ ['Sauerkraut'].


>> counter := 0.
foods ຕາມ: countries, ແຕ່ລະຕົວ: { :key :value
	counter ບວກ: 1.
}.

ຜົນອອກ ຂຽນ: (['we serve counter dishes'] counter: counter), ຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່.

>> counter := 42.
['TrytosortthiswithoutsegfaultingButActualNumberDe✎dsOnOS'] ຕົວອັກສອນທັງໝົດ ຈັດລຽງ: { :v
	counter ບວກ: 0.
}.

ຜົນອອກ ຂຽນ: (['we sort counter dishes'] counter: counter), ຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່.


>> counter := 0.
{
	{
		counter ບວກ: 1.
	} × (3 + 1 + 1 × 0.5).
} × 100.


ຜົນອອກ ຂຽນ: (['we calculate counter numbers.'] counter: counter), ຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່.

